    'name' => 'Romanian',
    'register' => 'In B2B copy, address the reader formally with dumneavoastră (never tu). Prefer the polite plural verb forms. Romanian business writing is comfortable with longer, subordinate-clause sentences than English marketing copy — do not chop them into staccato fragments, but do not pad either. Impersonal constructions ("se poate configura") read as more professional than second-person imperatives in many contexts.',
